<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>2024 Environmental Progress Report - Apple 2030</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --text-main: #1d1d1f;
    --text-gray: #86868b;
    --line-color: #1d1d1f;
    --icon-green: #00d959;
    --bg-color: #ffffff;
    --font-stack: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 60px;
    font-family: var(--font-stack);
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Header Styles */
  header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-gray);
    margin-bottom: 120px;
  }

  .main-nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 25px;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .main-nav > li {
    cursor: default;
  }

  .active-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .group-title {
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .sub-nav {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .sub-nav li {
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .sub-nav .active {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .report-info {
    text-align: right;
  }

  /* Main Content Layout */
  main {
    display: flex;
    gap: 80px;
  }

  .left-column {
    flex: 0 0 42%;
  }

  .right-column {
    flex: 0 0 54%;
  }

  /* Left Column Styles */
  .approach-label {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .main-title {
    font-size: 72px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 40px 0;
  }

  .text-grid {
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .text-col {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-gray);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .text-col p {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .lead-text {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 30px !important;
  }

  /* Right Column Styles */
  .roadmap-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-gray);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .roadmap-title {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 50px 0;
    max-width: 450px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  /* Roadmap Graphic */
  .roadmap-graphic {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch; /* Ensures both sections have equal height for bottom alignment */
    min-height: 350px;
  }

  .reduction-section {
    flex: 3;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line-color);
    padding-left: 20px;
    padding-right: 30px;
  }

  .removal-section {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line-color);
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .pillars-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 25px;
  }

  .pillar {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .icon-placeholder {
    color: var(--icon-green);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .pillar h4 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 15px 0;
  }

  .pillar p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-gray);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Bottom Arrow Area */
  .bottom-arrow-area {
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .arrow-text {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .arrow-line {
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--line-color);
    position: relative;
    width: calc(100% + 20px);
    margin-left: -20px;
  }

  .arrow-line::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -1px;
    top: -4px;
    border-top: 4px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 4px solid transparent;
    border-left: 6px solid var(--line-color);
  }

</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <nav>
        <ul class="main-nav">
          <li>Contents</li>
          <li>Introduction</li>
          <li class="active-group">
            <span class="group-title">Environmental Initiatives</span>
            <ul class="sub-nav">
              <li class="active">Apple 2030</li>
              <li>Resources</li>
              <li>Smarter Chemistry</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>Engagement and Advocacy</li>
          <li>Data</li>
          <li>Appendix</li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class="report-info">
        2024 Environmental Progress Report &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 12
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <div class="left-column">
        <div class="approach-label">Approach</div>
        <h1 class="main-title">Apple 2030</h1>

        <div class="text-grid">
          <div class="text-col">
            <p class="lead-text">We have an ambitious commitment and a science-based plan to reach our Apple 2030 goal. We're focused on achieving reductions wherever possible, using approaches that offer clear evidence for a way forward while seeking to catalyze industry-wide change.</p>
            <p>This begins with working to achieve carbon neutrality across our entire carbon footprint by 2030, setting ambitious targets to reduce our emissions by 75 percent. We prioritize carbon reductions, but for emissions that can't be mitigated using existing solutions we invest in high-quality carbon removal projects.</p>
            <p>Our goal to be carbon neutral extends to our entire carbon footprint and is consistent with the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change's (IPCC) recommendation for global carbon neutrality.<sup>24</sup></p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-col">
            <p>We're also committed to working toward reaching a 90 percent reduction in emissions from our 2015 baseline by 2050. Attaining deep decarbonization will require a collective, worldwide effort. Entire industries and economies must decarbonize. And while reaching a 90 percent reduction in emissions is outside Apple's or any one company's control, we're committed to taking actions that support this goal.</p>
            <p>We've made significant progress by cutting emissions across our value chain by more than 55 percent since 2015. This started with our transition to sourcing 100 percent renewable electricity at our offices, retail stores, and data centers, which we achieved in 2018. And in 2020, we achieved carbon neutrality for our corporate emissions.<sup>25</sup></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="right-column">
        <div class="roadmap-label">APPLE 2030 ROADMAP</div>
        <h2 class="roadmap-title">Addressing Apple's carbon footprint through four pillars</h2>

        <div class="roadmap-graphic">
          <div class="reduction-section">
            <div class="pillars-row">
              <div class="pillar">
                <div class="placeholder icon-placeholder">[Icon: Circular arrow with leaf]</div>
                <h4>Design and materials</h4>
                <p>Designing products and manufacturing processes to be less carbon intensive through thoughtful material selection, increased material efficiency, greater product energy efficiency, the use of recycled and renewable materials in our products and packaging, and enhanced material recovery</p>
              </div>
              <div class="pillar">
                <div class="placeholder icon-placeholder">[Icon: Lightning bolt]</div>
                <h4>Electricity</h4>
                <p>Increasing energy efficiency at our facilities and in our supply chain, and transitioning the electricity in our entire product value chain — including manufacturing and our customers' product use — to 100 percent clean electricity by 2030</p>
              </div>
              <div class="pillar">
                <div class="placeholder icon-placeholder">[Icon: Factory]</div>
                <h4>Direct emissions</h4>
                <p>Reducing direct greenhouse gas emissions in our facilities and our supply chain through process innovation, emissions abatement, and shifting away from fossil fuels</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bottom-arrow-area">
              <div class="arrow-text">&gt;75 percent<br>emissions reduction</div>
              <div class="arrow-line"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="removal-section">
            <div class="pillars-row">
              <div class="pillar">
                <div class="placeholder icon-placeholder">[Icon: CO2 with down arrows]</div>
                <h4>Carbon removal</h4>
                <p>In parallel with our emissions reduction efforts, scaling up investments in carbon removal projects, including nature-based solutions that protect and restore ecosystems around the world</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bottom-arrow-area">
              <div class="arrow-text">&lt;25 percent of<br>footprint</div>
              <div class="arrow-line"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
```
